-bonded-2018-11-14-e9","era":null,"summary":"Stuck, Ambrellin finally admits she is angry and tells Terrik his friends are leaving because of his behavior; Terrik walks away alone.","participants":["ambrellin","terrik"],"location":"basilica-of-the-opportune","importance":"major","page":"stories/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14","order":675,"story_date":"2018-11-14","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":123,"quote":"Okay I'm angry with you, are you happy?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14#:~:text=Okay%20I%27m%20angry%20with%20you%2C%20are%20you%20happy%3F","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bound and Bonded","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-14","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14#:~:text=Okay%20I%27m%20angry%20with%20you%2C%20are%20you%20happy%3F","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bound and Bonded\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 14 Nov 2018."}},{"id":"bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14-e10","era":null,"summary":"Terrik finds an Orzhov pontiff using abused wurms and spirits to dig for a missing piece of an Izzet coin machine.","participants":["terrik","the-orzhov-pontiff","the-coin-mill"],"location":"basilica-of-the-opportune","importance":"major","page":"stories/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14","order":675,"story_date":"2018-11-14","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":131,"quote":"Faster! It's got to be buried around here somewhere,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bound-and-bonded-2018-11-14#:~:text=Faster%21%20It%27s%20got%20to,buried%20around%20here%20somewhere%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bound and Bonded","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2018-11-14","url":"htt